.TH MONITOR-SENSOR 1 "October 2026" "iio-sensor-proxy 3.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
monitor-sensor \- monitor standard SensorProxy readings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B monitor-sensor
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Claim sensors through the net.hadess.SensorProxy system D-Bus service and print
reading changes until interrupted. The piano package includes the upstream
monitor without changes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --accel
Monitor accelerometer orientation.
.TP
.B --light
Monitor ambient light.
.TP
.B --help
Show all options implemented by this upstream version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR piano-sensors-check (1)
